{"id":"wb-6-860","name":"卧龙山千佛岩石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"卧龙山千佛岩石窟","text":"卧龙山千佛岩石窟位于四川省梓潼县城西南四十华里，文物遗址年代判定为唐。1956年8月16日公布为四川省第一批历史及革命文物保护单位。共40余龛，后面一龛，系明末重刻。1980年7月7日列为四川省重新确定公布的第一批省级文物保护单位。2006年5月25日公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%A7%E9%BE%99%E5%B1%B1%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E5%B2%A9%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":86588199,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86588199","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/46aa9604b10b07247a313846.jpg","title":"卧龙山千佛岩石窟国保碑.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8D%A7%E9%BE%99%E5%B1%B1%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E5%B2%A9%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7d/%E5%8D%A7%E9%BE%99%E5%B1%B1%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E5%B2%A9%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Mount. Wolong, Qianfoyan Grottoes","width":320,"height":213}}